Explore Sands at Nomad and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay, and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer at Sands at Nomad. Contactless check-in can be done before your arrival at your convenience. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended bucket list experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned. 
A personal concierge in your pocket! 

About the Resort:
Located on one of Africa’s best beaches, The Sands at Nomad is the ideal destination to enjoy a hassle-free beach holiday with impeccable service on Kenya’s Southern Coast.
The award-winning boutique resort is the perfect getaway for those wanting to experience the breath-taking Diani Beach.

Use the app to help:
- Complete the check in registration requirements contactless;
- Chat with the resort directly via the mobile app;
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant tables, excursions and activities such as snorkelling, scuba diving or spa treatments;
- View the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- Request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for a loved one;
- View your bills that you might incur while at the resort;
- Book your next stay at the resort.
